  "text": "Vet Cancer Care: Veterinary Oncologist Telehealth Services\nSkip to content\n03 9050 0671\nMon-Fri: 8am to 6pm\nSat-Sun: Emergency specialist referral surgery only\nHome\nServices\nHospital Services\nSurgery\nNeurosurgery\nDiagnostic Imaging\nInternal Medicine\nOncology\nMobile Services\nMobile Orthopaedic Surgery\nMobile Soft Tissue Surgery\nOncology Telehealth Consults\nReferring Vets\nRefer Online\nNew Vet Registration\nReferring Vet Login\nPet Owners\nAbout\nMeet the Team\nLatest News\nFAQs\nContact\nHome\nServices\nHospital Services\nSurgery\nNeurosurgery\nDiagnostic Imaging\nInternal Medicine\nOncology\nMobile Services\nMobile Orthopaedic Surgery\nMobile Soft Tissue Surgery\nOncology Telehealth Consults\nReferring Vets\nRefer Online\nNew Vet Registration\nReferring Vet Login\nPet Owners\nAbout\nMeet the Team\nLatest News\nFAQs\nContact\nHome\nServices\nHospital Services\nSurgery\nNeurosurgery\nDiagnostic Imaging\nInternal Medicine\nOncology\nMobile Services\nMobile Orthopaedic Surgery\nMobile Soft Tissue Surgery\nOncology Telehealth Consults\nReferring Vets\nRefer Online\nNew Vet Registration\nReferring Vet Login\nPet Owners\nAbout\nMeet the Team\nLatest News\nFAQs\nContact\nHome\nServices\nHospital Services\nSurgery\nNeurosurgery\nDiagnostic Imaging\nInternal Medicine\nOncology\nMobile Services\nMobile Orthopaedic Surgery\nMobile Soft Tissue Surgery\nOncology Telehealth Consults\nReferring Vets\nRefer Online\nNew Vet Registration\nReferring Vet Login\nPet Owners\nAbout\nMeet the Team\nLatest News\nFAQs\nContact\nOncology Vet Telehealth Appointments\nSpecialist cancer advice, now available via video consult. Connect with our oncology vet team remotely for timely, compassionate care.\nVeterinary Oncology Specialists\nOncology Vet Telehealth Appointments Now Available\nMARS\nunderstands how important timely vet cancer care is for pets and peace of mind for their families. We are proud to now offer oncology vet\ntelehealth appointments with our veterinary oncologist\n, providing expert guidance, treatment planning, and compassionate support—no matter where you are.\nWhat Is an Oncology Vet Telehealth Appointment?\nAn oncology vet telehealth consultation allows pet owners and referring veterinarians to connect directly with our oncology vet team via secure video conferencing. Whether you’re seeking a second opinion, guidance on diagnostics, or a detailed treatment plan, our telehealth service brings expert vet cancer care closer to home. Following each consult a detailed individualised plan is created and sent out to pet owner and referring veterinarian.\nWho Can Benefit?\nPet Owners\nlooking for expert advice, second opinions, or help understanding their pet’s diagnosis and treatment options.\nReferring Veterinarians\nwanting to collaborate on complex cases or access specialist input for their patients in regional or remote areas.\nWhat to Expect\nA comprehensive review of your pet’s history, diagnostics, and current condition.\nClear explanations of diagnosis, prognosis, and treatment options.\nCollaboration with your primary vet to create a cohesive care plan.\nOngoing support and guidance through your pet’s cancer journey following referral to MARS.\nHow to Book\nAppointments can be scheduled via our Melbourne animal cancer care team. Please email your patient’s history, and test results to\nour team and we will be in touch to will your client for a telehealth appointment with our veterinary oncologist. At present, these are scheduled every Thursday and Friday.\nExpert vet cancer care support is just a video call away—Get started today!\nSend Email\nExplore Oncology Services\nHave a question for our surgeons?\nOur wonderful team are ready to provide the best care\nContact us\nWe are dedicated to achieving the best possible outcomes for every pet and pet owner.\nWe accept\nVetPay\nand\nAfterpay.\nVisit our sister hospital for more specialist support at Geelong Animal Referral Services\nContact us\n03 9050 0671\nenquiries@marsvets.com.au\n619 Whitehorse Road, Mitcham VIC 3132\nMon-Fri: 8am to 6pm\nSat-Sun: Emergency specialist referral surgery only\nFacebook\nInstagram\nLinkedin\n© 2025 Melbourne Animal Referral Services  |\nPrivacy\nABN: 76 652 987 310\nMARS IS MOVING!\nFrom\nMonday,\n31\nst\nAugust\n,\nwe will be located at our NEW address:\n619 Whitehorse Road,\nMitcham VIC 3132.\nPlease contact our team if you have any questions.\nGet in touch\nGet directions\nWE’VE MOVED — FIND US AT 619 WHITEHORSE ROAD, MITCHAM VIC 3132.\nGet directions",
